    "text": "<p>Match List I with List II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td>Sulphate</td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Pesticide</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td>Fluoride</td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Bending of bones</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td>Nicotine</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Laxative effect</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td>Sodium arsinite</td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Herbicide</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>"
